  "prefLabel": "Mhp 200 PRACTICE AND PROCEDURE",
  "recordType": "rule-chapter",
  "ruleText": "CHAPTER Mhp 200 PRACTICE AND PROCEDURE\n\nREVISION NOTE:\n\nDocument #14181, effective 2-20-25, repealed Part Mhp 201 through Part Mhp 214 in Chapter Mhp 200, titled “Practice and Procedures”. Document #14181 also adopted a new Part Mhp 201 titled “Rules of Practice and Procedure”, containing Mhp 201.01 titled “Rules of Practice and Procedure.”\n\nDocument #14181 replaces all prior filings affecting the rules in the former Chapter Mhp 200. The prior filings included the following documents:\n\n#7624, eff 1-10-02, EXPIRED: 1-10-10\n\n#9853-A, eff 1-25-11\n\n#9853-B, eff 1-25-11\n\n#10745, eff2-20-25\n\nAs practice and procedure rules, the rules in Document #14181 will not expire except pursuant to RSA 541-A:17, II.",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/mhp200.html"
